OL,3,ABadenoch unveils plan to end #100,000
OL,4,Achildcare 'cliff edge' ahead of Tory
OL,5,Aconference
OL,6,
OL,7,FKemi Badenoch has said a Conservative
OL,8,Fgovernment would scrap the "cliff edge"
OL,9,Fthat mean parents in England lose out
OL,10,Fon childcare support when they earn
OL,11,Fmore than #100,000 a year.
OL,13,FSpeaking to the BBC's Laura Kuenssberg,
OL,14,Fthe Conservative Party leader said:
OL,15,F"What we want to see is that people who
OL,16,Fwork harder don't get punished for
OL,17,Fdoing so."
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
