OL,3,ABadenoch unveils plan to end #100,000
OL,4,Achildcare 'cliff edge' ahead of Tory
OL,5,Aconference
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe earnings limit means only families
OL,8,Fwhere no parent earns more than this
OL,9,Fthreshold are eligible for
OL,10,Fgovernment-funded or tax-free
OL,11,Fchildcare.
OL,13,FThe announcement comes as Conservative
OL,14,Fmembers gather for the party's annual
OL,15,Fconference in Birmingham.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
