OL,3,AAustralia investigating Flydubai
OL,4,Aco-pilot's links to country
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Australian authorities have not
OL,7,Fidentified the co-pilot, who has been
OL,8,Fnamed by multiple media outlets
OL,9,Fincluding Reuters, CNN and The New York
OL,10,FTimes as Hamam al-Hammami.
OL,12,FThe prosecutor in the UAE has said it
OL,13,Fis investigating the incident and any
OL,14,Fpossible motives.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
