OL,3,ATennessee prison chief to resign after
OL,4,AChrista Pike's failed execution
OL,5,
OL,6,FPike, who was sentenced to death in
OL,7,F1996 for the murder of Colleen Slemmer,
OL,8,Fsurvived two injections and is now in
OL,9,Fcritical condition at a Tennessee
OL,10,Fhospital as her lawyers seek to commute
OL,11,Fher sentence.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
